# 💬 OPIc Expressions - Day 03

## Expression

One of the reasons is that...

Meaning

이유 중 하나는 ~이다.

---

## Examples

One of the reasons is that English is useful.

One of the reasons is that I enjoy learning new things.

---

## Useful Alternatives

- The main reason is...
- That's because...
- One thing I like is...
